blocks.explanation:
Data visualisation raw data ko charts aur graphs mein badalti hai, taake:
- patterns, trends aur outliers (alag thalag values) jaldi nazar aayen;
- mushkil nataij samajhna aur har qisam ke logon ko batana aasan ho;
- ghaltiyan aur ghalat-fehmiyan kam hon.

Data ka akhlaqi istemal logon ki hifazat karta aur bharosa banata hai:
- privacy aur raazdari ka ehtram; data ijazat (consent) se liya jaye aur sirf usi maqsad ke liye use ho;
- models se imtiyazi sulook (discrimination) aur ghalat istemal rukta hai;
- data par mabni faisle munsifana, durust aur qabil-e-bharosa rehte hain.
